Package: kite-desktop
Version: 1.1.1
Section: x11
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Maintainer: KiteOS builder <root@localhost>
Depends: xfce4-session, xfwm4, xfce4-panel, xfdesktop4, xfce4-settings, xfconf, thunar, xfce4-terminal,
 xfce4-power-manager, xfce4-power-manager-plugins, xfce4-pulseaudio-plugin, xfce4-docklike-plugin,
 xfce4-notifyd, xfce4-screensaver, exo-utils, rofi, lightdm, slick-greeter, orchis-gtk-theme,
 papirus-icon-theme, x11-xserver-utils, procps, python3, kite-system
Recommends: fonts-roboto | fonts-dejavu-core, xfce4-taskmanager, brave-browser, onlyoffice-desktopeditors
Description: KiteOS ChromeOS-style desktop
 XFCE configured as a light ChromeOS-like desktop: bottom shelf with a
 bottom-left app launcher menu (tap the Search key), pinned apps beside it, status
 area and clock; Orchis theme with Papirus icons; LightDM slick-greeter login
 screen and KiteOS artwork.
